        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as a young panda pilot whose loving mother spent the family savings to buy you your very first delivery drone — and even registered your business under <strong>P.A.N.D.A. (Prompt Agile New Delivery Alliance)</strong>. Now it’s your turn to take to the skies and make her proud!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across a colorful, open world filled with animal characters and hidden surprises. Deliver parcels big and small while exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some deliveries are urgent and must arrive on time, while others let you slow down, relax, and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of flight. Always keep an eye on your <strong>battery levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re uncovering secrets, delivering parcels, or simply admiring the view from above, every flight brings you closer to becoming the best delivery panda pilot in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore a vibrant open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Deliver parcels to animal inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Both urgent timed deliveries or laid-back routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛽ Manage fuel to plan your flights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐼 Play as a lovable panda pilot with a big heart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight, deliver hope, and bring the world closer together — one parcel at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notices:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Controllers REQUIRED to play the game in 2 player split-screen mode (local co-op).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 1: keyboard+mouse / Gamepad 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2: Gamepad 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user is not able to access all of the gameplay functions using only a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features simplified, easy-to-learn controls designed for casual players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it doesn’t use realistic drone flight physics, you can customize button and joystick mappings in the options menu to suit your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as a young panda pilot whose loving mother spent the family savings to buy you your very first delivery drone — and even registered your business under <strong>P.A.N.D.A. (Prompt Agile New Delivery Alliance)</strong>. Now it’s your turn to take to the skies and make her proud!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across a colorful, open world filled with animal characters and hidden surprises. Deliver parcels big and small while exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some deliveries are urgent and must arrive on time, while others let you slow down, relax, and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of flight. Always keep an eye on your <strong>battery levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re uncovering secrets, delivering parcels, or simply admiring the view from above, every flight brings you closer to becoming the best delivery panda pilot in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore a vibrant open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Deliver parcels to animal inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Both urgent timed deliveries or laid-back routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛽ Manage fuel to plan your flights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐼 Play as a lovable panda pilot with a big heart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight, deliver hope, and bring the world closer together — one parcel at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notices:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Controllers REQUIRED to play the game in 2 player split-screen mode (local co-op).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 1: keyboard+mouse / Gamepad 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2: Gamepad 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user is not able to access all of the gameplay functions using only a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=